# Generate m17 L17 b10 comp sheet asset

Generated `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b10_comp-sheet.png` from the built-in image generation workflow using the requested gpt-image-2 prompt and supplied BMH doodle references.

The selected candidate had the right two-document composition, empty upper blue space, yellow header band, simple black line strokes, and orange seal. It included soft gradients, so I used the candidate as the source, resized it to 1600 x 900, hard-mapped it to the locked six-color course palette, then repaired the five horizontal strokes so they stay plain black.

