- Corner pixel samples all report exact `#62B3F3`.
- Visual inspection confirms two overlapping paper documents, generous clean blue space above, a white front sheet with yellow header band, five plain black line strokes, one orange seal circle, no people, no text, no symbols, and no decorative clutter.
- `git check-ignore -v course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b10_comp-sheet.png` confirms the saved asset is under the existing `course-assets/` ignore rule.

