+---
+
+# Generate m17 L17 b10 written plan scores asset
+
+## Goal
+
+Generate one course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b10_written-plan-scores.png`.
+
+## Scope
+
+- Use the attached BMH course doodle references and locked flat sticker-sheet style.
+- Use gpt-image-2 through the built-in image generation workflow.
+- Create one 1600 x 900 PNG.
+- Show a blank written plan connected by a simple black line to a blank role scorecard board.
+- Make the image clearly show that the written plan governs the scorecard scoring.
+- Leave clean bottom-center cornflower-blue space for code-rendered sticker text.
+- Use thick wobbly black outlines, rounded simple shapes, flat fills only, and the locked palette: cornflower blue, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black.
+- Avoid people, readable text, letters, numbers, symbols, tables with figures, dollar signs, money, ambient doodles, motion marks, random props, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective depth.
+
+## Verification
+
+- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
+- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
+- Confirm local palette flattening leaves only locked course colors.
+- Visually inspect for the written plan, the role scorecard board, one connecting black line, clean bottom-center blue space, and no forbidden elements.

